      <bpmn:documentation>Trigger: Deliverable due; stage-gate (W3548); quality plan
Frequency: Per deliverable + continuous
Volume: All deliverables
Owner: Project Manager / Quality
Participants: Project Manager, Quality (links to VS-31), Team, Sponsor, Vendors/Contractors, End-users
Source: workflow W3557 — Project Quality, Deliverable &amp; Acceptance Management</bpmn:documentation>
