      </bpmn:startEvent>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W3557_Task5" name="Project Manager/Quality define the project quality plan: quality…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 1: Project Manager/Quality define the project quality plan: quality standards/criteria per deliverable, acceptance criteria, QA/QC activities (reviews, inspections, testing), and roles; align to quality management (links to VS-31) and domain standards (e.g., construction links to VS-20/W3488, IT links to VS-27/W132)
Responsible (R): Project Manager / Quality
Accountable (A): Sponsor
Duration: Per project</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W3557_Flow11</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W3557_Flow12</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W3557_Task6" name="Project Manager/Team execute QA/QC: deliverable reviews, inspections, testing…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 2: Project Manager/Team execute QA/QC: deliverable reviews, inspections, testing, defect management, and corrective action; manage vendor/contractor quality (links to VS-03/VS-34); document results
Responsible (R): Project Manager / Quality / Team
Accountable (A): Sponsor
Duration: Per deliverable</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W3557_Flow12</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W3557_Flow13</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W3557_Task7" name="Sponsor/End-users conduct deliverable acceptance against criteria (links to…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 3: Sponsor/End-users conduct deliverable acceptance against criteria (links to domain acceptance e.g., VS-37/W3488, VS-40/W1828): approve/conditionally-accept/reject, manage punch-list/snag closure, and sign off; feed quality issues to lessons (W3560) and vendor scorecard (links to VS-67)
Responsible (R): Sponsor / End-users / Project Manager
Accountable (A): Sponsor
Duration: Per deliverable</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W3557_Flow13</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W3557_Flow14</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:endEvent id="W3557_End8" name="Complete">
        <bpmn:incoming>W3557_Flow14</bpmn:incoming>
      </bpmn:endEvent>
