      <bpmn:documentation>Trigger: Project initiation; risk/issue event
Frequency: Continuous + per project
Volume: All projects
Owner: Project Manager
Participants: Project Manager, Team, PMO, Risk (links to VS-21.2), Sponsor, Stakeholders
Source: workflow W3558 — Project Risk, Issue &amp; Decision Management</bpmn:documentation>
