      <bpmn:startEvent id="W3558_Start4" name="Project initiation; risk/issue event">
        <bpmn:outgoing>W3558_Flow11</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:startEvent>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W3558_Task5" name="Project Manager maintain the project risk register: identify/assess risks…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 1: Project Manager maintain the project risk register: identify/assess risks (probability/impact), owners, mitigation/contingency, and triggers; integrate significant risks to portfolio risk (W3550) and ERM (links to VS-21.2)
Responsible (R): Project Manager / Risk
Accountable (A): Sponsor
Duration: Continuous</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W3558_Flow11</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W3558_Flow12</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W3558_Task6" name="Project Manager manage issues and decisions: log issues (impact, owner, action…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 2: Project Manager manage issues and decisions: log issues (impact, owner, action, due), resolve/escalate, and capture key decisions (decision-log with rationale/owner); manage escalations to sponsor/governance
Responsible (R): Project Manager
Accountable (A): Sponsor
Duration: Continuous</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W3558_Flow12</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W3558_Flow13</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W3558_Task7" name="PMO aggregate project risks/issues/decisions to the portfolio view (W3550)…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 3: PMO aggregate project risks/issues/decisions to the portfolio view (W3550), monitor critical risks/issues, and report to governance (W3552); feed risk/issue lessons to methodology (W3548) and lessons (W3560)
Responsible (R): PMO
Accountable (A): PMO Director
Duration: Monthly</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W3558_Flow13</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W3558_Flow14</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
