      <bpmn:documentation>Trigger: Project initiation; communications plan
Frequency: Per plan + event-driven
Volume: All projects/programs
Owner: Project Manager / Program Manager
Participants: Project Manager, Sponsor, Stakeholders, PMO, Communications (links to VS-14.3/VS-103.2), Change Mgmt (links to W3568)
Source: workflow W3559 — Project Communications &amp; Stakeholder Management</bpmn:documentation>
