        <bpmn:documentation>Step 1: Project Manager develop the stakeholder and communications plan: stakeholder map/analysis (interest/influence), communication needs/channels/frequency (status reports, steering meetings, town-halls, emails), and roles; align to corporate comms (links to VS-14.3) and change mgmt (links to W3568)
Responsible (R): Project Manager / Sponsor
Accountable (A): Sponsor
Duration: Per project</bpmn:documentation>
