    <bpmn:process id="W_W3560" name="W3560. Project Closure, Handover &amp; Lessons Learned" isExecutable="false">
      <bpmn:documentation>Trigger: Project completion; stage-gate close
Frequency: Per project
Volume: All projects
Owner: Project Manager / PMO
Participants: Project Manager, Sponsor, Finance (links to VS-40), Delivery-domain/Ops (links to VS-07/VS-20.3/etc.), Quality (links to VS-31), Audit (links to VS-21), End-users
Source: workflow W3560 — Project Closure, Handover &amp; Lessons Learned</bpmn:documentation>
      <bpmn:laneSet id="W3560_LaneSet2">
        <bpmn:lane id="W3560_Lane1" name="Project Manager">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W3560_Task4</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W3560_Task5</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W3560_Task6</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W3560_Start3</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W3560_End7</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
      </bpmn:laneSet>
      <bpmn:startEvent id="W3560_Start3" name="Project completion; stage-gate close">
        <bpmn:outgoing>W3560_Flow10</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:startEvent>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W3560_Task4" name="Project Manager close the project: deliverable/acceptance sign-off (W3557)…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 1: Project Manager close the project: deliverable/acceptance sign-off (W3557), snag/punch-list closure, financial closure (final cost, commitments, retention release links to VS-40/W1828/W3493), contract/vendor closure (links to VS-03/VS-34), and documentation/archive (links to VS-88)
Responsible (R): Project Manager / Finance
Accountable (A): Sponsor
Duration: Per project</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W3560_Flow10</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W3560_Flow11</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W3560_Task5" name="Project Manager hand over to operations/business owner (e.g., store ops links…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 2: Project Manager hand over to operations/business owner (e.g., store ops links to VS-07, facilities links to VS-20.3, IT ops links to VS-27): training, O&amp;M/manuals, support transition, and asset handover (links to VS-35/W1828); confirm operational readiness
Responsible (R): Project Manager / Ops Owner
Accountable (A): Sponsor
Duration: Per project</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W3560_Flow11</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W3560_Flow12</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W3560_Task6" name="Project Manager/PMO capture lessons learned (what worked/didn&#x27;t, root causes…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 3: Project Manager/PMO capture lessons learned (what worked/didn&#x27;t, root causes, recommendations), publish to the knowledge base (links to VS-30.3/VS-88), feed methodology/templates (W3548/W3566) and future projects, and transition benefits tracking to BAU (W3561)
Responsible (R): Project Manager / PMO
Accountable (A): PMO Director
Duration: Per project</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W3560_Flow12</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W3560_Flow13</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:endEvent id="W3560_End7" name="Complete">
        <bpmn:incoming>W3560_Flow13</bpmn:incoming>
      </bpmn:endEvent>
      <bpmn:textAnnotation id="W3560_Annotation8">
        <bpmn:text>Controls: - CTL-566 (ensure controlled execution — Program &amp; Project Delivery Management, Resource &amp; Capacity (PA-112.2).) | - operational: closure checklist; operational: knowledge base and methodology feedback
Owner: Project Manager / PMO</bpmn:text>
      </bpmn:textAnnotation>
